guide forever/class/druid/cat-form
title Cat Form
category Class
folder Druid
keywords Cat Form, The Great Cat Spirit, The Great Windborne Cat Spirit, Avatar of Saeyleenan, Blessings of the Great Cat Spirit, Stormrage Barrow Dens, Relic of the Fang, Relic of the Claw, Relic of the Silent Shadow, Moonglade, Skyborne, class quest
reward spell 768 "Cat Form"
why Your stealth and melee form: in Forever this chain gives Cat Form at 20, not the trainer.
class Druid
levels 20-22
zone Moonglade

# Cat Form, Forever-new at level 20 (Forever's druid class quest list lists
# the chain as new): your trainer sends you to Dendrite Starblaze in
# Moonglade, who sends you to the Great Cat Spirit (Night Elves, Tauren) or
# the Avatar of Saeyleenan (Skyborne, the Windborne quests 98341, 98404,
# 98738); three relics from the Stormrage Barrow Dens, then back to Dendrite
# and your trainer.
# - Alliance: The Great Cat Spirit (98393, Mathrengyl Bearwalker) -> 98394,
#   98396, 98731 (Night Elves) or 98341, 98404, 98738 (Skyborne) -> To
#   Darnassus (98397).
# - Horde: The Great Cat Spirit (98340, Turak Runetotem) -> 98405, 98342,
#   98739 (Tauren) or 98341, 98404, 98738 (Skyborne) -> To Thunder Bluff
#   (98362).
# The leveling guides carry the chain inline (alliance/03-darkshore,
# horde/04-the-barrens): this guide is for druids off our route.
# Sources: quests.json (Questie 12.1.0, Forever) and the relic points and
# tips of the leveling guides above (from players' reports in the first
# weeks of the beta).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Alliance

step The Great Cat Spirit
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Darnassus
  tip Mathrengyl Bearwalker stands in the Cenarion Enclave. Skyborne without the Rut'theran flight path: take the boat from Auberdine.
  level 20
  accept 98393                          -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker

step Dendrite Starblaze
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven; learn the flight path there if you do not have it.
  turnin 98393                          -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 98394 only NightElf
  accept 98341 only Skyborne
  getfp "Moonglade"

step The relics of the Barrow Dens
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  tip The Great Cat Spirit (Night Elves) waits on the southern hill above the bridge, the Avatar of Saeyleenan (Skyborne) south of the twin bridges. The relics lie in the Stormrage Barrow Dens east of the lake: leave your form, click the statue at the entrance for five minutes of stealth, keep clear of the spirits inside and take one of each relic; the Relic of the Silent Shadow lies at the foot of the white cat statue. A relic gives no loot while another player is looting it: wait a moment and try again.
  turnin 98394 only NightElf            -- Great Cat Spirit
  accept 98396 only NightElf
  turnin 98341 only Skyborne            -- Avatar of Saeyleenan
  accept 98404 only Skyborne
  collect 280502 quest 98396.1 @72.4,66.0 only NightElf -- Relic of the Fang
  collect 280679 quest 98396.2 @75.2,67.2 only NightElf -- Relic of the Claw
  collect 280680 quest 98396.3 @74.4,65.4 only NightElf -- Relic of the Silent Shadow
  collect 280502 quest 98404.1 @72.4,66.0 only Skyborne -- Relic of the Fang
  collect 280679 quest 98404.2 @75.2,67.2 only Skyborne -- Relic of the Claw
  collect 280680 quest 98404.3 @74.4,65.4 only Skyborne -- Relic of the Silent Shadow
  turnin 98396 only NightElf            -- Great Cat Spirit
  accept 98731 only NightElf
  turnin 98404 only Skyborne            -- Avatar of Saeyleenan
  accept 98738 only Skyborne

step Back to Dendrite
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  tip Back to Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven, then fly to Rut'theran Village.
  turnin 98731 only NightElf            -- Dendrite Starblaze
  turnin 98738 only Skyborne
  accept 98397
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

step To Darnassus
  only NightElf,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Darnassus
  tip Take the portal up to Mathrengyl in the Cenarion Enclave.
  turnin 98397                          -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Cat Form

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Horde

step The Great Cat Spirit
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Turak Runetotem stands on Elder Rise.
  level 20
  accept 98340                          -- Turak Runetotem

step Dendrite Starblaze
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven.
  turnin 98340                          -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 98405 only Tauren
  accept 98341 only Skyborne

step The Stormrage Barrow Dens
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  tip The Great Cat Spirit (Tauren) waits on the southern hill above the bridge, the Avatar of Saeyleenan (Skyborne) south of the twin bridges. The relics lie in the Stormrage Barrow Dens east of the lake: leave your form, click the statue at the entrance for five minutes of stealth, keep clear of the spirits inside and take one of each relic; the Relic of the Silent Shadow lies at the foot of the white cat statue. A relic gives no loot while another player is looting it: wait a moment and try again.
  turnin 98405 only Tauren              -- Great Cat Spirit
  accept 98342 only Tauren
  turnin 98341 only Skyborne            -- Avatar of Saeyleenan
  accept 98404 only Skyborne
  collect 280502 quest 98342.1 @72.4,66.0 only Tauren -- Relic of the Fang
  collect 280679 quest 98342.2 @75.2,67.2 only Tauren -- Relic of the Claw
  collect 280680 quest 98342.3 @74.4,65.4 only Tauren -- Relic of the Silent Shadow
  collect 280502 quest 98404.1 @72.4,66.0 only Skyborne -- Relic of the Fang
  collect 280679 quest 98404.2 @75.2,67.2 only Skyborne -- Relic of the Claw
  collect 280680 quest 98404.3 @74.4,65.4 only Skyborne -- Relic of the Silent Shadow
  turnin 98342 only Tauren              -- Great Cat Spirit
  accept 98739 only Tauren
  turnin 98404 only Skyborne            -- Avatar of Saeyleenan
  accept 98738 only Skyborne

step Back to Dendrite
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  tip Back to Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven, then take Bunthen Plainswind's flight to Thunder Bluff.
  turnin 98739 only Tauren              -- Dendrite Starblaze
  turnin 98738 only Skyborne
  accept 98362
  fly "Thunder Bluff"

step To Thunder Bluff
  only Tauren,Skyborne,Horde
  zone Thunder Bluff
  turnin 98362                          -- Turak Runetotem: Cat Form
